---

## List Categories

```http
GET /categories
```

### Headers

- `x-api-key`: `<your_client_api_key>` (or `Authorization: Bearer <key>`)

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "cat_indie",
    "name": "Indie",
    "slug": "indie",
    "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "cat_pop",
    "name": "Pop",
    "slug": "pop",
    "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  }
]
```
